      "value": "Yep, so the update was pushed to release, what two days ago? controllers are still borked. I had an official vrchat member assist me through screen sharing to try and fix my bindings. we got it so that the game is playable, albeit highly restrictive.\n\nIt boils down to this, my gestures are completely broken.\n\nI can either have the emulated D pad north south east west and center positions control some gestures (which makes my gestures play like crazy every time i move or rotate). Having it set up like this also means my palm trigger and index finger trigger are unusable.\n\nOr I can have my palm trigger and index finger trigger usable again but the emulated D pad gestures don't work.\n\nI am almost 100 percent positive I could create proper bindings now that I've had hours of time learning how to use the new bindings system HOWEVER THERE IS ONE SMALL ISSUE there is ABSOLUTLY NO COMBINATION OF BINDINGS THAT CAN BE CREATED BECAUSE OF THE DEFAULT IDLE HAND POSITION\n\nWhen no buttons are pressed, no gestures are active, whatever internally the game recognizes as the idle gesture or idle pose or whatever IS FREAKING BACKWARDS. open palm gesture SHOULD NOT FREAKING BE THE DEFAULT IDLE GESTURE!!! WTF?!?\n\nY'all got a true where it needs to be a false in your games logic somewhere.",
